@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam dpi 180
title Datos usados por el aporte de Rodrigo
entity "users.json" as U {
 id
 email
 password
 passwordVersion
}
entity "routes.json" as R {
 id
 driverId
 notes
 time
 expiresAtTimestamp
 seats
 totalSeats
 initialSeats
}
entity "bookings.json" as B {
 id
 routeId
 driverId
 passengerId
 status
 routeSnapshot
 pickupPoint
}
entity "claims.json" as C {
 id
 code
 passengerId
 reporterRole
 routeId
 reservationId
 routeSnapshot
 description
 status
 requestId
 emailStatus
}
U ||--o{ R : publica
U ||--o{ B : reserva
R ||--o{ B : viaje
U ||--o{ C : autor
R ||..o{ C : referencia histórica
B |o..o{ C : reserva opcional
note bottom of C
passengerId identifica al autor incluso si es conductor.
Relaciones lógicas sin claves foráneas de base de datos.
Las instantáneas conservan contexto histórico.
end note
@enduml
